      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            { "name": "Lace weight yarn (white or ecru)", "qty": "90 m" },
            { "name": "3.5 mm crochet hook", "qty": "1" },
            { "name": "Tapestry needle", "qty": "1" }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Centre" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Magic ring. Round 1: ch 5, *3 tr into ring, ch 5; repeat 3 times (4 corner spaces with 3 tr each). Join. Round 2: work 3 tr, ch 5, 3 tr into each corner space (corner increases)." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Rounds 3 to 8" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Continue working 3 tr, ch 5, 3 tr at each corner. Along each side, add chain arcs and treble clusters every round, maintaining the square shape. By round 8 each side should measure approx. 28 cm." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Finishing" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Fasten off and weave in the end. Block by pinning the four corners square and misting." }]
      }
    ]
